    operatingFrequency: 'Fixed cadence, at minimum quarterly, with monthly overdue-action tracking', evidenceRequired: ['Last two fraud reports on the standard template', 'Forum terms of reference naming the standing agenda item', 'Minutes recording decisions and owners', 'Overdue-action ageing schedule'],
